WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.610
okay before I do anything else today I

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:01.620
 

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:03.290
want to take a second to thank all of

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:03.300
 

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.090
you who have supported the Rubin Report

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:05.100
 

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.160
since we went independent back in June

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:07.170
 

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:09.230
that goes for all of you who watch

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:09.240
 

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.270
engage with and share our videos but

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:11.280
 

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.310
especially for those of you who have

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:13.320
 

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.900
donated to The Rubin Report via

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:14.910
 

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:18.380
Patreon or Paypal. Almost 3,000 of you

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:18.390
 

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:19.820
can proudly consider yourselves

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:19.830
 

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:22.070
producers of this show. You not only give

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:22.080
 

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.870
us the monthly budget to continue The

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:23.880
 

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.700
Rubin Report every week but you also

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:25.710
 

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.980
keep the show free for everybody else.

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:27.990
 

00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:29.990
This show based on big ideas and honest

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:30.000
 

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.120
conversations, talking to people who I

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:32.130
 

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.610
both agree with and disagree with, is

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:34.620
 

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.380
really just at the beginning of what we

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:36.390
 

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:37.910
can do as our own production company.

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:37.920
 

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:39.920
We've got some big plans and i'll

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:39.930
 

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.660
explain those in just a second.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:41.670
 

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:43.310
The way we produce The Rubin Report

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:43.320
 

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:45.440
right now is with nothing between me and

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:45.450
 

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.180
you, the audience. There's no producer

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:47.190
 

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:48.619
screaming in my ear telling me what to

00:00:48.619 --> 00:00:48.629
 

00:00:48.629 --> 00:00:50.510
say and there's no corporate Overlord

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:50.520
 

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:52.220
telling me what to do.

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:52.230
 

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.139
I truly wouldn't trade this intellectual

00:00:54.139 --> 00:00:54.149
 

00:00:54.149 --> 00:00:55.939
freedom for a million-dollar contract on

00:00:55.939 --> 00:00:55.949
 

00:00:55.949 --> 00:00:56.930
CNN.

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:56.940
 

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:58.729
So with this in mind we've decided to

00:00:58.729 --> 00:00:58.739
 

00:00:58.739 --> 00:01:01.340
take the final step into becoming fully,

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:01.350
 

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:03.770
truly independent. Over the past few

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:03.780
 

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:05.600
weeks our production company took out a

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:05.610
 

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:08.240
major loan to build a home studio. Life's

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:08.250
 

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:10.010
about taking risks - we've already taken a

00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:10.020
 

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:11.420
couple of them and we figured why not

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:11.430
 

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:14.240
take one more? Once we fully build this

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:14.250
 

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:16.100
studio out which is happening as we

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:16.110
 

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:16.969
speak,

00:01:16.969 --> 00:01:16.979
 

00:01:16.979 --> 00:01:18.890
we'll be able to shoot whenever we want,

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:18.900
 

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.749
for however long we want. This will give

00:01:20.749 --> 00:01:20.759
 

00:01:20.759 --> 00:01:22.609
The Rubin Report incredible flexibility

00:01:22.609 --> 00:01:22.619
 

00:01:22.619 --> 00:01:24.859
not only to shoot more shows every week

00:01:24.859 --> 00:01:24.869
 

00:01:24.869 --> 00:01:27.410
but also to do more collaborations with

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:27.420
 

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.330
people you know and love, host real

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:29.340
 

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.429
debates on polarizing topics, and come up

00:01:31.429 --> 00:01:31.439
 

00:01:31.439 --> 00:01:34.130
with new ideas for segments on the fly.

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:34.140
 

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.140
Ultimately the best way to share these

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:36.150
 

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:37.910
ideas of free speech and honest

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:37.920
 

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:40.160
conversation is for me to be beholden

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:40.170
 

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:42.950
to nobody but you, the fans. That's really

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:42.960
 

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:44.600
the beauty of what's going on here. You

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:44.610
 

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:46.370
guys have helped us grow and share this

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:46.380
 

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.020
message across the globe.

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:48.030
 

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:49.670
I genuinely love connecting with our

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:49.680
 

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:51.770
Patrons every month via our private

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:51.780
 

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:54.109
Google Hangouts, the patreon group chat,

00:01:54.109 --> 00:01:54.119
 

00:01:54.119 --> 00:01:55.819
our exclusive live streams, and more.

00:01:55.819 --> 00:01:55.829
 

00:01:55.829 --> 00:01:58.550
Beyond that i'm amazed and awed how many

00:01:58.550 --> 00:01:58.560
 

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:00.080
of you guys are connecting with each

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:00.090
 

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:01.910
other and starting your own blogs or

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:01.920
 

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:03.679
YouTube channels or just bringing these

00:02:03.679 --> 00:02:03.689
 

00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:06.139
conversations to your dinner table. So

00:02:06.139 --> 00:02:06.149
 

00:02:06.149 --> 00:02:08.089
for those of you who are in Patrons yet

00:02:08.089 --> 00:02:08.099
 

00:02:08.099 --> 00:02:09.680
this is your chance to become a producer

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:09.690
 

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.900
of The Rubin Report and help us hit our

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:11.910
 

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:13.140
next goals.

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:13.150
 

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:14.850
To show we're serious about growing the show,

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:14.860
 

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:16.890
and fast, we'll be starting to do two

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:16.900
 

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:19.500
interviews per week beginning next week.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:19.510
 

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:22.170
Yep, double the content immediately. Help us

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:22.180
 

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:24.000
get to our next goals on Patreon and the

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:24.010
 

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:26.009
show will grow as much as you want it to.

00:02:26.009 --> 00:02:26.019
 

00:02:26.019 --> 00:02:28.110
Everything we're doing at The Rubin

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:28.120
 

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.119
Report is because you've enabled us to

00:02:30.119 --> 00:02:30.129
 

00:02:30.129 --> 00:02:32.399
continue to do it. I hate to sound corny

00:02:32.399 --> 00:02:32.409
 

00:02:32.409 --> 00:02:35.220
but you make me a better man. Speaking of

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:35.230
 

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:37.110
better people my producer David and my

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:37.120
 

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.910
head of production Amiria are seriously

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:38.920
 

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.649
the best team in the business.

00:02:40.649 --> 00:02:40.659
 

00:02:40.659 --> 00:02:42.210
These are truly the hardest-working

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:42.220
 

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.979
people in the biz and more importantly

00:02:43.979 --> 00:02:43.989
 

00:02:43.989 --> 00:02:45.360
they never yell at me for tweeting too

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:45.370
 

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:48.569
much. Together we can do this show for a

00:02:48.569 --> 00:02:48.579
 

00:02:48.579 --> 00:02:51.420
year for roughly the same cost as one

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:51.430
 

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:54.210
episode of a cable news show.

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:54.220
 

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:55.500
We weren't expecting to make this move

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:55.510
 

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:57.330
so quickly but the timing really is

00:02:57.330 --> 00:02:57.340
 

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:59.280
perfect. The media landscape is changing

00:02:59.280 --> 00:02:59.290
 

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:01.920
so fast and our true independence will

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:01.930
 

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:03.720
be the key to growing not only the show,

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:03.730
 

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.970
but a real political movement. The

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:05.980
 

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:08.490
election is absolute proof that we need

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:08.500
 

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.020
to tackle difficult topics and

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:10.030
 

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:12.569
controversial ideas honestly. Most people

00:03:12.569 --> 00:03:12.579
 

00:03:12.579 --> 00:03:14.339
don't want the endless fighting we've

00:03:14.339 --> 00:03:14.349
 

00:03:14.349 --> 00:03:16.440
become accustomed to, but we're the ones

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:16.450
 

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:18.509
who have to fight to be heard the most.

00:03:18.509 --> 00:03:18.519
 

00:03:18.519 --> 00:03:21.300
This is my call to action to all of you,

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:21.310
 

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.009
not only can you help keep this message

00:03:23.009 --> 00:03:23.019
 

00:03:23.019 --> 00:03:25.110
alive but you can help grow it with no

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:25.120
 

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:26.580
outside influence and with nothing

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:26.590
 

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:27.659
between us.

00:03:27.659 --> 00:03:27.669
 

00:03:27.669 --> 00:03:29.520
Alright so if you've heard me and you

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:29.530
 

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:31.439
feel what I feel, jump over to

00:03:31.439 --> 00:03:31.449
 

00:03:31.449 --> 00:03:34.050
patreon.com/rubinreport or

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:34.060
 

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.449
rubinreport.com/donate and check out our

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:36.459
 

00:03:36.459 --> 00:03:38.339
next goals and some of the plans we have

00:03:38.339 --> 00:03:38.349
 

00:03:38.349 --> 00:03:40.589
to grow The Rubin Report. And if you

00:03:40.589 --> 00:03:40.599
 

00:03:40.599 --> 00:03:41.849
don't have the means right now than I

00:03:41.849 --> 00:03:41.859
 

00:03:41.859 --> 00:03:43.289
hope you'll just keep watching and

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:43.299
 

00:03:43.299 --> 00:03:46.170
sharing our videos. In short, the future

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:46.180
 

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:48.420
of the human civilization is up to you. I

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:48.430
 

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:55.019
hope you'll join us for this wild ride.

